  caption says the Collector inspected 'எலையமுத்தூர் சாலை மாணவர் விடுதியில் குடிநீர், உணவு வசதிகள்' - the article mentions drinking water among basic facilities, so this matches.
  reel_script omits that the inspection in Chinnaveerampatti covered 2 additional houses and nurseries as separate facts; the reel mentions them, so not missing.
  reel_script ends by naming the page 'திருப்பூர் த்ரீ சிக்ஸ்டி' which is the allowed closing sentence and is not a problem.
